      "doc": {
        "summary": "Copyable custom window shadow configuration, carried by a C ABI handle.",
        "details": "Distances are logical pixels. The blur radius is the finite support radius of a three-pass box approximation to a Gaussian. Zero draws a hard shadow. Defaults: black at 30% opacity, radius 18, offset (0, 6). Applying or retrieving a configuration copies it; subsequent edits have no effect until SetCustomShadow() is called again."
